VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'whole boat produces own water. We have fresh water from the lake, cleaning it. We have waste water system, so you don\'t have to headache with that. &gt;&gt; As well as water filtration, at the core of Eric\'s business is Victron Energy'

[01:50] [scene:talk]
