AUDIO: 'solar energy. And depends on the batteries, the capacity, we can be from April till September off-grid on the lake, even in the marina, because of our big terraces, you can choose how many solar panels you want. We have a 48-V'

[02:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'system. We can use it for all the electricity aboard, also for electric engines or hybrid systems. So, we can drive fully powered by solar. And for example, the solar station, we brought it here today to Berlin from our shipyard in Brandenburg. And the whole'

